      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_c_03",
      "hash64": "0E996FB5BB587BF6",
      "text": "Oh, ach ja.[VAR 0x0114(0008)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 11,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0008"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_c_04",
      "hash64": "0E9972B5BB58810F",
      "text": "Gerüchten zufolge sollen Leute von Team Star\\nauf dem Weg hierher sein, um zu randalieren...[VAR 0x0114(0008)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 91,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0008"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_c_05",
      "hash64": "0E9971B5BB587F5C",
      "text": "Obwohl ich mir ziemlich sicher bin, dass sich das\\nnur jemand aus der Nase gezogen hat, der sich\\r\\nnoch immer vor uns fürchtet...[VAR 0x0114(0008)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 95,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 129,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0008"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_c_06",
      "hash64": "0E9974B5BB588475",
      "text": "Ich meine, warum sollte jemand ausgerechnet in\\nden Kunstraum reinplatzen und randalieren...?[VAR 0x0114(0008)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 92,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0008"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_c_hono_01",
      "hash64": "32C34BE2DE9BCEED",
      "text": "Platz da, hier kommen wir![VAR 0x0114(001F)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 26,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001F"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_c_07",
      "hash64": "0E9973B5BB5882C2",
      "text": "Was?! Sie sind wirklich gekommen?[VAR 0x0114(0008)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 33,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0008"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_c_kakutou_01",
      "hash64": "BC38D191D225A331",
      "text": "Boah, krass! Eine Staraptor-Figur! Sieht aus,\\nals würde es Nahkampf einsetzen![VAR 0x0114(0022)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 78,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0022"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_c_hono_02",
      "hash64": "32C348E2DE9BC9D4",
      "text": "Hey, du da... Gehörst du zur Kunst-AG?[VAR 0x0114(001F)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 38,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001F"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_c_student_01",
      "hash64": "FAD62A53CBFFD714",
      "text": "Ähm, ja...",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_c_hono_03",
      "hash64": "32C349E2DE9BCB87",
      "text": "...[VAR 0x0114(001F)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 3,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001F"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_c_08",
      "hash64": "0E9976B5BB5887DB",
      "text": "Dann stimmen die Gerüchte doch?!\\nDas kann nicht sein...[VAR 0x0114(0008)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 55,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0008"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_c_09",
      "hash64": "0E9975B5BB588628",
      "text": "Nein, das glaub ich einfach nicht.\\nWarten wir mal ab, was passiert.[VAR 0x0114(0008)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 67,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0008"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_c_student_02",
      "hash64": "FAD62D53CBFFDC2D",
      "text": "Kann... ich euch irgendwie helfen?",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_c_hono_04",
      "hash64": "32C346E2DE9BC66E",
      "text": "Ja, kannst du! Also hoff ich zumindest, äh...\\nIch w-würde nämlich gern d-deee...[VAR 0x0114(001F)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 80,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001F"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_c_student_03",
      "hash64": "FAD62C53CBFFDA7A",
      "text": "Du würdest gern „d-deee“ was...?",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_c_hono_05",
      "hash64": "32C347E2DE9BC821",
      "text": "DEMOLIEREN![VAR 0x0114(001F)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 11,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001F"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_c_10",
      "hash64": "0E9608B5BB55971A",
      "text": "WAS?! Also sind sie wirklich hier, um zu\\nrandalieren?![VAR 0x0114(0008)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 54,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0008"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_c_kakutou_02",
      "hash64": "BC38CE91D2259E18",
      "text": "Äh, ich glaube, du wolltest was anderes sagen,\\noder, Irsita?[VAR 0x0114(0022)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 60,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0022"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_c_kakutou_03",
      "hash64": "BC38CF91D2259FCB",
      "text": "Ich weiß, dass du nervös bist, aber an deinen\\nAblenkungsmanövern müssen wir noch arbeiten.[VAR 0x0114(0022)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 90,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0022"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_c_hono_06",
      "hash64": "32C344E2DE9BC308",
      "text": "S-Sorry, Riobita...[VAR 0x0114(001F)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 19,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001F"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 24,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_c_hono_07",
      "hash64": "32C345E2DE9BC4BB",
      "text": "Es ist so, ich... Ich würd gern d-der... der AG\\nbeitreten. Der Kunst-AG...[VAR 0x0114(001F)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 74,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001F"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 25,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_c_student_04",
      "hash64": "FAD62753CBFFD1FB",
      "text": "Ach sooo! Du willst unserer AG beitreten?\\nSag das doch gleich! Hab ich mich erschreckt...",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 26,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_c_student_05",
      "hash64": "FAD62653CBFFD048",
      "text": "Natürlich heißen wir neue Mitglieder jederzeit\\nwillkommen, aber...",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 27,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_c_kakutou_04",
      "hash64": "BC38D491D225A84A",
      "text": "Super! Siehst du, Irsita? War alles halb so wild.[VAR 0x0114(0022)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 49,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0022"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 28,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_c_hono_08",
      "hash64": "32C342E2DE9BBFA2",
      "text": "Nicht so schnell, Riobita. Du hast wohl das dicke\\n„Aber“ am Ende überhört. Gibt’s irgendwelche\\r\\nBedingungen, die ich erfüllen muss, oder wie?[VAR 0x0114(001F)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 94,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 143,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001F"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 29,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_c_student_06",
      "hash64": "FAD62953CBFFD561",
      "text": "Ähm, also, ich müsste wissen, aus welchem Grund\\ndu der Kunst-AG beitreten möchtest...",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 30,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_c_hono_09",
      "hash64": "32C343E2DE9BC155",
      "text": "Du willst wissen, warum?[VAR 0x0114(001F)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 24,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001F"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 31,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_c_hono_10",
      "hash64": "32C6B0E2DE9EB063",
      "text": "Tja, meine Klamotten und meine Treter hat ’n\\nKumpel von mir zusammengeschnippelt.[VAR 0x0114(001F)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 81,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001F"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 32,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_c_hono_11",
      "hash64": "32C6AFE2DE9EAEB0",
      "text": "Und ich find das Design einfach überragend.\\nMan sieht, was für ein Feuer in jedem einzelnen\\r\\nHandgriff steckt. So was will ich auch können.[VAR 0x0114(001F)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 91,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 141,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001F"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 33,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_c_hono_12",
      "hash64": "32C6B2E2DE9EB3C9",
      "text": "Nur nicht mit Klamotten, sondern mit Bildern![VAR 0x0114(001F)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 45,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001F"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 34,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_c_hono_13",
      "hash64": "32C6B1E2DE9EB216",
      "text": "Bisher hab ich halt überhaupt keinen Plan\\ndavon...[VAR 0x0114(001F)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 50,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001F"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 35,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_c_hono_14",
      "hash64": "32C6B4E2DE9EB72F",
      "text": "Aber dann hab ich das Dartiri-Bild dort an der\\nWand gesehen und gedacht, yo, wenn das okay\\r\\nist, dann reichen meine Kritzeleien vielleicht auch.[VAR 0x0114(001F)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 90,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 146,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001F"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 36,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_c_student_07",
      "hash64": "FAD62853CBFFD3AE",
      "text": "Das Dartiri-Bild...? Das, äh... ist von mir...",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 37,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_c_hono_15",
      "hash64": "32C6B3E2DE9EB57C",
      "text": "Echt jetzt?! Das sieht aus wie von ’nem\\nFünfjährigen gemalt![VAR 0x0114(001F)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 60,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001F"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 38,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_c_student_08",
      "hash64": "FAD62353CBFFCB2F",
      "text": "Hahaha, das hör ich nicht zum ersten Mal!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
