    },
    {
      "ordinal": 39,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_c_mobs_01",
      "hash64": "B969FCA4B7C06176",
      "text": "Die Bilder unseres AG-Leiters überzeugen\\ngerade aufgrund ihrer Einfachheit.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 40,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_c_hono_16",
      "hash64": "32C6B6E2DE9EBA95",
      "text": "Hä? Du bist der AG-Leiter?![VAR 0x0114(001F)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 27,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001F"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 41,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_c_mobs_02",
      "hash64": "B969FBA4B7C05FC3",
      "text": "Willkommen in unserer AG! Wie heißt du denn\\neigentlich?",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 42,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_c_mobs_03",
      "hash64": "B969FAA4B7C05E10",
      "text": "Das sind echt coole Schuhe! Darf ich sie mir mal\\naus der Nähe ansehen?",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 43,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_c_hono_17",
      "hash64": "32C6B5E2DE9EB8E2",
      "text": "I-Ich bin Irsa... Die Schuhe gehen übelst ab, oder?\\nHat ein Kumpel für mich gemacht. Der kleine\\r\\nNerd hat’s echt drauf![VAR 0x0114(001F)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 95,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 121,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001F"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 44,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_c_11",
      "hash64": "0E9609B5BB5598CD",
      "text": "So viel zur Randale... Bin ich erleichtert, dass es\\nwirklich nur ein Missverständnis war. Aber Irsita\\r\\nin der Kunst-AG zu sehen, überrascht mich...[VAR 0x0114(0008)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 101,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 149,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0008"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 45,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_c_kakutou_05",
      "hash64": "BC38D591D225A9FD",
      "text": "Ich bin total auf ihr erstes Bild gespannt.[VAR 0x0114(0022)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 43,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0022"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 46,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_c_12",
      "hash64": "0E9606B5BB5593B4",
      "text": "Ich auch...[VAR 0x0114(0008)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 11,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0008"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 47,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_c_13",
      "hash64": "0E9607B5BB559567",
      "text": "M-Moment mal! Du wusstest, dass wir euch\\nbeobachten?![VAR 0x0114(0008)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 53,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0008"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 48,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_c_kakutou_06",
      "hash64": "BC38D291D225A4E4",
      "text": "Habt ihr etwa versucht, euch hier zu verstecken?!\\nDafür lungert ihr nämlich ziemlich auffällig rum...[VAR 0x0114(0022)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 101,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0022"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 49,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_c_kakutou_07",
      "hash64": "BC38D391D225A697",
      "text": "Aber ich glaube nicht, dass Irsita euch bemerkt\\nhat. Dafür war sie viel zu nervös.[VAR 0x0114(0022)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 82,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0022"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 50,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_c_14",
      "hash64": "0E9604B5BB55904E",
      "text": "Wirklich? Ich hätte nicht gedacht, dass sie jemals\\nwegen irgendwas nervös wird...[VAR 0x0114(0008)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 81,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0008"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 51,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_c_kakutou_08",
      "hash64": "BC38C891D22593E6",
      "text": "Na ja, jeder hat doch Angst vor neuen Sachen.\\nDeshalb hab ich sie auch begleitet. Aber ich\\r\\nglaube, sie kommt jetzt ganz gut allein zurecht.[VAR 0x0114(0022)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 90,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 142,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0022"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 52,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_c_kakutou_09",
      "hash64": "BC38C991D2259599",
      "text": "Ach ja! Wusstest du, dass ich zusammen mit\\nMispa eine Wrestling-AG gegründet hab?[VAR 0x0114(0022)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 81,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0022"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 53,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_c_kakutou_10",
      "hash64": "BC3C5691D228BB07",
      "text": "Irsita soll schließlich nicht die Einzige sein,\\ndie hier an der Akademie ihren Spaß hat![VAR 0x0114(0022)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 88,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0022"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 54,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_c_kakutou_11",
      "hash64": "BC3C5591D228B954",
      "text": "Okay, ich verdünnisier mich dann mal.\\nHasta la vistar![VAR 0x0114(0022)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 54,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0022"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 55,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_c_15",
      "hash64": "0E9605B5BB559201",
      "text": "...[VAR 0x0114(0008)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 3,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0008"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 56,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_c_16",
      "hash64": "0E9602B5BB558CE8",
      "text": "Riobita und Irsita sind voll dabei, sich zu\\nintegrieren...[VAR 0x0114(0008)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 58,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0008"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 57,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_c_17",
      "hash64": "0E9603B5BB558E9B",
      "text": "Vielleicht sollte ich auch langsam...\\nEgal. Also dann, hasta la vistar![VAR 0x0114(0008)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
